WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

The MIT terms above apply to the source code of this project and to nothing
else. Two sets of files in this repository are not the author's to license,
and the permission granted above does not extend to them:

  assets/banknotes/*      120 images of the design proposals for the future
                          euro banknotes. Copyright European Central Bank.
                          Reproduced for information purposes. The ECB permits
                          informational, editorial and news use; commercial,
                          promotional or merchandising use, alteration,
                          misleading presentation, and any use implying ECB or
                          Eurosystem endorsement all require prior written
                          permission. The images must always be identified as
                          design proposals, citing the ECB as the source.
                          https://www.ecb.europa.eu/euro/banknotes/future_banknotes/html/design-proposals.en.html

  src/design-texts.js     The ECB's own descriptions of the ten designs, in
                          five languages, taken from the corresponding
                          language versions of the page above. Copyright
                          European Central Bank.

If you reuse this project, the code comes with it; the images and the ECB's
texts do not. Fetch them yourself under the ECB's terms, or replace them.

This project is independent. It has no relationship with the European Central
Bank or the Eurosystem, and no bearing on the official choice of design.
